2026-11-13 17:54:14,039 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] ### INVESTIGATION OVERVIEW
2026-11-13 17:54:14,040 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] This investigation examined forensic evidence from a data staging and anti-forensics scenario involving removable media (USB drive RM2 and CD-R rm3.E01), a Windows 7 system (INFORMANT-PC), and network drive access during March 2015. The initial investigation presented 16 findings describing a coordinated data exfiltration attack. Counter-analysis has substantially revised the assessment through investigation of the underlying data source and exfiltration evidence.
