2026-11-13 17:54:14,041 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] The investigation confirms a coherent attack chain across 4+ kill chain phases:
2026-11-13 17:54:14,041 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 1. **Initial Access/Data Collection (3/22):** System installation at 14:34:26 UTC, followed 18 minutes later by network drive access (10.11.11.128/secured_drive/Common Data) at 14:52:22 UTC
2026-11-13 17:54:14,042 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 2. **Data Staging (3/24):** "Secret Project Data" folders staged to USB drive (staging timestamps 09:59:27-10:00:18 UTC) and CD-R (burn sessions with 9 VAT generations, timestamps 20:54:16-20:55:46 UTC)
2026-11-13 17:54:14,043 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 3. **File Concealment:** Systematic file extension masquerading (16+ files with false extensions) - confirmed as real signature mismatches via tsk.masquerade tool
2026-11-13 17:54:14,043 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] 4. **Defense Evasion/Anti-Forensics (3/25):** Coordinated execution of Eraser and CCleaner tools within 46 minutes of login (14:45:59-15:13:30 UTC), followed by system shutdown
